
Right now we only created 2 sample documents:

Plain Text
docs/linux/linux-basic.txt
docs/runbooks/db-recovery.txt
 

But remember our folder structure is:

Plain Text
docs
├── linux
├── security
├── network
├── runbooks
└── incidents

If only 2 files exist, the AI has very little knowledge. We must populate all folders.

docs/linux

Already created:

Plain Text
linux-basic.txt
 

Create more files:

Shell
nano docs/linux/file-management.txt

Content:

Plain Text
Linux File Management
 
ls = list files
 
cp = copy files
 
mv = move files
 
rm = remove files
Shell
nano docs/linux/process-management.txt

Content:

Plain Text
Linux Process Management
 
ps aux = show processes
 
top = monitor processes
 
kill PID = stop process
